WEBVTT

00:01.130 --> 00:03.430
Always keep a good poker face.

00:03.430 --> 00:05.010
Taking his father's teaching to heart...

00:05.010 --> 00:07.140
The miraculous magician glides amidst the skyscrapers.

00:07.140 --> 00:08.560
In comes Kaitou Kid!

00:08.970 --> 00:12.180
Today's target is Beaucoup de Soleil à Paris.

00:12.640 --> 00:14.440
Now, let the show begin!

01:41.770 --> 01:49.160
Detective Conan is brought to you by these sponsors.

01:56.500 --> 02:01.500
THE PRINCESS PREFERS MAGIC

02:20.560 --> 02:22.150
Please pose for the camera, Princess Anne!

02:22.150 --> 02:23.610
Please face this way too!

02:25.690 --> 02:27.440
Welcome to Japan, Princess Anne.

02:28.240 --> 02:33.330
We've heard the purpose of your visit is the famous
paintings and gems exhibition from the Duchy of Sabrina.

02:33.330 --> 02:35.580
Is that diamond on your chest the famous...

02:35.580 --> 02:37.370
"Beaucoup de Soleil à Paris"?

02:35.580 --> 02:37.370
Lots of Sunshine in Paris

02:37.620 --> 02:38.580
Yes.

02:38.580 --> 02:40.580
Will that be put on display too?

02:40.580 --> 02:41.130
Yes.

02:41.880 --> 02:46.300
I would like to treat my fellow friends in
Japan to the sight of it as much as possible.

02:46.880 --> 02:49.010
Of course, that goes for Kaitou Kid too.

02:51.220 --> 02:53.850
So can we take that as a challenge for Kid?

02:54.260 --> 02:55.180
Yes.

02:55.180 --> 02:58.060
However, I absolutely will not allow him to steal it.

02:58.520 --> 03:00.270
To commemorate this event...

03:00.270 --> 03:04.690
We will hold an opening party at
the exhibition hall tomorrow night.

03:04.690 --> 03:08.240
For this party, as long as you can show me magic...

03:08.240 --> 03:10.570
You are invited whether you are a professional or an amateur.

03:11.110 --> 03:14.280
I would also like to welcome children
to participate to their heart's content.

03:14.280 --> 03:15.950
A party?

03:15.950 --> 03:17.290
They didn't tell me!

03:17.290 --> 03:20.120
If they do something like that, who knows
how taxing my security work will become...

03:20.620 --> 03:21.500
Belmondo!

03:22.620 --> 03:24.960
Someone, stop my Belmondo!

03:27.460 --> 03:29.550
Goochy goochy, come to pap—

03:48.650 --> 03:50.490
You can't do that, Belmondo.

03:51.200 --> 03:52.860
What the hell was that!?

03:52.860 --> 03:53.780
I'll arrest you!

03:55.240 --> 03:56.700
So it was you?

03:56.700 --> 04:00.080
The clumsy inspector who's been dancing to Kaitou Kid's tune.

04:00.080 --> 04:02.330
Who the hell do you think you are!?

04:02.330 --> 04:05.080
Europe's No.1 and the most astute police detective...

04:06.710 --> 04:08.500
Delon is my name.

04:08.880 --> 04:11.170
Detective Delon; I've heard about him.

04:11.510 --> 04:14.970
In order to catch the culprit, he'd resort
to firearms without blinking an eye.

04:15.550 --> 04:18.180
Good timing, let me say this to you first.

04:18.180 --> 04:22.430
We won't be requiring assistance for our
party from the likes of you Japanese police.

04:23.560 --> 04:24.600
Don't require...?

04:25.020 --> 04:29.110
How could we possibly trust your squad
that has continuously let Kid slip away?

04:29.860 --> 04:33.400
Our police force from the Duchy
of Sabrina is sufficient enough.

04:37.160 --> 04:38.740
This is for Kaitou Kid.

04:39.120 --> 04:43.370
You've been rumored as the Japanese
Arsène Lupin even in my country, but...

04:43.370 --> 04:46.710
You're just another petty thief in my eyes.

04:46.710 --> 04:50.880
If you wish to obtain the gem glittering in
front of the princess's chest, come forth.

04:50.880 --> 04:53.130
I shall arrest you within three seconds!

04:56.510 --> 04:59.930
A VOW TO APPREHEND
KAITOU KID!!

04:59.640 --> 05:01.350
WHAT THE!?

05:05.730 --> 05:07.020
Kuroba Kaito!

05:07.020 --> 05:09.020
Put your cell phone away while class is in session!

05:12.780 --> 05:14.280
Such an idiot.

05:14.280 --> 05:16.780
You've been awestruck by the cute princess, haven't you?

05:16.780 --> 05:17.030
A VOW TO APPREHEND
KAITOU KID!!

05:17.030 --> 05:19.200
PRINCESS ANNE WELCOMES
KAITOU KID!!

05:20.990 --> 05:23.580
She really is cute!

05:24.290 --> 05:25.750
Aoko-kun...

05:25.750 --> 05:28.170
Don't tell me you're jealous?

05:28.170 --> 05:30.290
That's not it!

05:30.290 --> 05:31.300
It's just my dad...

05:32.800 --> 05:35.590
My dad's been pretty down lately.

05:35.590 --> 05:37.930
Dancing to the tune of the whimsical princess...

05:37.930 --> 05:39.930
And having been taken off the security team...

05:39.930 --> 05:42.430
He said he has no way to catch Kid.

05:42.430 --> 05:46.480
If Kid were actually captured by that Detective Delon...

05:49.860 --> 05:52.820
If we're talking about a hack inspector like your old man...

05:52.820 --> 05:54.690
It can't be helped that he was dropped!

05:55.110 --> 05:56.200
What's that!?

05:56.200 --> 05:58.410
I'm seriously worrying about this!

05:58.410 --> 05:59.200
Jerkaito!

05:59.870 --> 06:01.200
What'd you say, Bimboko!?

06:01.200 --> 06:02.870
How dare you!

06:03.240 --> 06:04.370
It's you who called me Jerkaito first!

06:04.370 --> 06:05.410
Hello...

06:05.410 --> 06:07.080
We're still in class...

06:11.840 --> 06:12.880
That damned Aoko...

06:13.250 --> 06:14.670
Calling me "Jerkaito" like that!

06:19.470 --> 06:20.260
Inspector?

06:21.970 --> 06:23.640
Oh, Kaito-kun.

06:23.640 --> 06:25.020
What's wrong?

06:25.020 --> 06:25.970
Sitting here like this...

06:28.190 --> 06:29.980
I feel like I'm useless.

06:30.810 --> 06:35.110
When I think of how I have to shut up and
turn a blind eye to Kaitou Kid's appearance...

06:36.240 --> 06:38.950
I've been chasing that guy thus far.

06:38.950 --> 06:42.530
But just like what the satiric Detective Delon said...

06:42.530 --> 06:46.120
I have not once been able to apprehend him.

06:46.120 --> 06:47.910
I just can't read his moves...

06:47.910 --> 06:50.790
That bastard's actions, that bastard's methods, everything!

06:53.090 --> 06:55.880
Sorry to have bored you with such complaints.

06:55.880 --> 06:57.300
It's nothing...

06:57.300 --> 06:58.590
That's right, Kaito-kun.

06:58.590 --> 07:01.300
Can you show me one of your magic tricks?

07:01.300 --> 07:02.300
My magic tricks?

07:02.510 --> 07:06.640
Aoko always raves about how amazing your magic tricks are.

07:08.100 --> 07:09.100
All right then.

07:09.100 --> 07:10.560
I'll show you a simple one.

07:11.520 --> 07:13.230
There are no gimmicks or contraptions.

07:13.690 --> 07:14.980
Please watch carefully.

07:21.450 --> 07:22.860
They're gone!?

07:23.410 --> 07:24.740
Here's what's incredible!

07:28.250 --> 07:30.410
But it's actually not that incredible.

07:31.370 --> 07:34.920
I simply had to draw your attention to my left hand...

07:34.920 --> 07:37.880
While my right hand was actually preparing for the next step.

07:38.090 --> 07:40.220
I do it quickly so spectators won't catch on.

07:40.220 --> 07:42.300
It's essential for magicians.

07:43.640 --> 07:48.220
Come to think of it, Kaitou Kid is a magician too, isn't he?

07:48.470 --> 07:49.980
I see...

07:50.270 --> 07:53.900
Since he's a magician, he'd also lure
his opponents to another place...

07:54.560 --> 07:56.730
Magic tricks are not sorcery.

07:56.730 --> 07:59.740
There really are gimmicks and contraptions, Inspector.

07:59.740 --> 08:00.740
Kaito-kun...

08:01.030 --> 08:02.030
I beg you!

08:02.030 --> 08:05.320
Won't you come to the party of the Duchy of Sabrina with me?

08:06.370 --> 08:07.950
To the party with you, Inspector?

08:07.950 --> 08:10.750
Only those who can perform magic tricks are allowed in.

08:10.750 --> 08:13.080
If you can accompany me, I'll be able to get in too!

08:13.420 --> 08:17.170
If I cheer the inspector up, Aoko will be enlivened too, huh...

08:17.340 --> 08:19.130
But what should I do?

08:19.170 --> 08:21.920
I beg you, Kaito-kun!

08:22.420 --> 08:23.970
I have a long-cultivated hunch!

08:23.970 --> 08:26.680
That guy's definitely going to show up tonight!

08:33.310 --> 08:35.270
Of course I would've come too...

08:35.520 --> 08:37.360
But to think I'm with the inspector!

08:37.770 --> 08:40.650
Hey, why have you come too, Aoko?

08:40.650 --> 08:42.360
Do I have a choice?

08:42.360 --> 08:44.070
I'm worried about Dad.

08:47.620 --> 08:49.870
Regardless, what do you think about my dress?

08:50.620 --> 08:53.410
You borrowed it from the drama club or something, didn't you?

08:53.410 --> 08:55.170
What was that!?

08:55.170 --> 08:57.790
But what an impressively long line.

09:22.400 --> 09:23.440
My goodness...

09:23.440 --> 09:26.740
Are they telling us to perform magic
tricks under heavy surveillance?

09:26.820 --> 09:29.280
It won't do for you to assemble so many guards like this!

09:29.620 --> 09:31.330
You'll be walking into Kid's trap!

09:32.410 --> 09:33.370
Hold on, Dad!

09:33.870 --> 09:37.620
The more guards you gather, the
easier his tricks will go through!

09:37.620 --> 09:40.250
Why are you here at such a place?

09:42.050 --> 09:43.510
Inspector Nakamori.

09:47.550 --> 09:48.840
Aoko...

09:48.840 --> 09:51.810
The pressure's getting to me — I need to go to the restroom.

09:52.100 --> 09:53.430
Wait, now?

09:55.480 --> 09:57.350
Geez, that Kaito!

09:57.890 --> 10:01.310
Detective Delon, some words of advice for you.

10:01.310 --> 10:03.780
Reduce the number of police officers immediately!

10:05.150 --> 10:07.820
To think I'm getting advice from a guy like you?

10:07.820 --> 10:09.820
You don't need this many people!

10:09.820 --> 10:11.700
What I don't need the most is you!

10:11.910 --> 10:13.870
I said hold on a minute, Dad!

10:14.410 --> 10:16.580
What happened, Detective Delon?

10:16.580 --> 10:17.660
What might be the commotion?

10:18.000 --> 10:20.580
No, everything is fine.

10:21.000 --> 10:23.550
My, what a cute girl you are!

10:25.340 --> 10:26.670
Ms. Princess...

10:28.510 --> 10:29.970
Marvelous!

10:30.640 --> 10:32.350
Welcome to our party.

10:32.350 --> 10:33.510
It's Kaitou Kid!

10:33.510 --> 10:34.680
Kaitou Kid has appeared!

10:38.690 --> 10:40.270
Evacuate the princess!

10:40.270 --> 10:41.610
Terminate the party now!

10:41.610 --> 10:42.360
Roger!

10:42.480 --> 10:44.150
Where's Kid!?

10:44.150 --> 10:44.730
Hey, wait!

10:47.110 --> 10:48.570
No way...

11:02.210 --> 11:03.540
What!?

11:06.130 --> 11:07.170
My clothes were taken!

11:07.460 --> 11:08.760
Where's Kaitou Kid?

11:08.760 --> 11:11.380
He's already slipped himself into the party hall!

11:12.390 --> 11:14.350
So he's disguised as a police officer?

11:14.350 --> 11:15.140
Go search!

11:15.140 --> 11:15.640
Roger!

11:22.230 --> 11:24.940
Well, allow me to borrow your clothes for a bit.

11:30.610 --> 11:32.280
Kaitou Kid has appeared!

11:32.280 --> 11:34.320
Gather in the party hall immediately.

11:34.910 --> 11:36.410
This is per Detective Delon's order!

11:36.660 --> 11:37.290
Roger!

11:39.160 --> 11:40.210
Bye bye.

11:40.410 --> 11:41.790
Please exit the premises.

11:41.790 --> 11:42.750
This way please.

11:42.750 --> 11:44.130
Please exit in a calm manner.

11:44.330 --> 11:46.170
But Kaito's not back...

11:46.170 --> 11:47.590
And where's Dad?

11:51.630 --> 11:53.430
That's what I've been telling you!

11:53.430 --> 11:56.640
With this many officers around, how
could you possibly know which is Kid?

11:56.640 --> 11:58.180
Why are you still here?

11:58.180 --> 12:00.680
Unauthorized personnel should leave this instant!

12:03.850 --> 12:05.690
Somehow it looks like there's more of them?

12:06.400 --> 12:08.190
Hey, where did the princess go?

12:08.190 --> 12:09.730
Is the security all right?

12:09.730 --> 12:10.570
No need to worry.

12:11.950 --> 12:14.660
Kid should be aiming for the princess's gem.

12:15.820 --> 12:19.580
Come to think of it, Kaitou Kid is a magician too, isn't he?

12:23.960 --> 12:27.340
So if he lured us to another location, right now he should be...

12:30.090 --> 12:32.630
Whew, there's a lot of them!

12:32.630 --> 12:33.340
This must be it.

12:36.340 --> 12:37.930
Kaitou Kid has appeared!

12:38.560 --> 12:41.100
Leave this place to me and hurry to the first floor!

12:41.100 --> 12:44.520
Listen up, Kid has disguised himself as Inspector Nakamori!

12:44.520 --> 12:45.850
Yes, sir!

12:54.650 --> 12:55.950
Who the hell are you!?

12:55.950 --> 12:57.780
This place is off-limits to the unauthorized!

12:58.450 --> 13:00.290
So this guy is Kid's new disguise!?

13:00.290 --> 13:01.450
WRONG!

13:04.330 --> 13:06.540
Boring, how boring!

13:07.130 --> 13:10.210
The party was just getting started...

13:10.210 --> 13:14.170
But now it feels like I'm being locked away in prison!

13:14.170 --> 13:17.680
I wonder if that Kaitou Kid really showed up?

13:17.680 --> 13:20.390
Say, what do you think, Belmondo?

13:22.930 --> 13:23.560
Who's there?

13:28.690 --> 13:31.150
What the, I don't see anyone here!

13:31.570 --> 13:34.320
Where on earth have the myriad of police officers gone to!?

13:40.200 --> 13:41.200
So it's white.

13:43.950 --> 13:44.660
Who are you?

13:45.960 --> 13:47.080
I am a thief.

13:49.040 --> 13:50.500
Could it be you're...

13:52.710 --> 13:54.880
I have arrived to accept your challenge.

14:02.560 --> 14:04.020
What the hell's with you!?

14:04.020 --> 14:05.680
Gathering here at the same time!

14:05.680 --> 14:07.270
We've captured Kid!

14:07.600 --> 14:08.940
What, where?

14:15.860 --> 14:19.490
To what extent do you plan to get in my goddamn way!?

14:21.070 --> 14:24.410
But, we were informed that Kid was
disguised as Inspector Nakamori...

14:24.410 --> 14:26.660
By you, Detective Delon, when we were upstairs earlier!

14:27.710 --> 14:28.920
It's a trap!

14:28.920 --> 14:30.210
Kid is upstairs!

14:30.380 --> 14:33.670
My, I appreciate your coming all the way here so much!

14:35.260 --> 14:37.510
I'm so glad that I came to Japan!

14:37.510 --> 14:40.470
To think I actually got to see Kaitou Kid!

14:40.470 --> 14:44.180
Your fame has spread all over the Duchy of Sabrina!

14:44.180 --> 14:45.020
Uhm...

14:46.100 --> 14:47.890
What do I do, what do I do?

14:49.640 --> 14:52.060
Oh yes, I have a fan site for you!

14:52.060 --> 14:53.230
Would you like to take a look?

14:53.400 --> 14:54.940
Your highness, uhm...

14:55.320 --> 14:57.820
Can I take a picture with you!?

14:57.820 --> 15:00.110
Your highness, what about the challenge...

15:00.110 --> 15:03.200
Oh dear, I wouldn't dream to challenge you!

15:03.200 --> 15:06.490
I've always been a faithful fan of yours!

15:07.910 --> 15:09.460
Do make yourself at home.

15:09.460 --> 15:11.040
Oh, how about a game of chess?

15:11.040 --> 15:12.750
I'm pretty good at it!

15:11.670 --> 15:12.750
Hey, hey...

15:16.050 --> 15:17.130
You idiots!

15:17.130 --> 15:18.760
How stupid is this to cram in all at once!?

15:20.880 --> 15:24.850
Your highness, regretfully, not much time remains.

15:26.140 --> 15:28.890
Regarding the jewel resting on your chest...

15:28.890 --> 15:31.390
Please consider bequeathing it to this humble thief.

15:32.480 --> 15:33.690
I see...

15:33.690 --> 15:38.110
But you know, this is a precious
gem received from my father.

15:38.440 --> 15:39.900
I hesitate to just hand it over...

15:40.530 --> 15:42.530
I am only borrowing it for a short while.

15:42.530 --> 15:45.030
I shall return it to your highness in a timely manner.

15:45.620 --> 15:47.290
Please have faith in me.

15:47.290 --> 15:49.080
A humble thief tells no lies.

15:53.540 --> 15:54.670
Belmondo!

15:54.920 --> 15:56.500
My, this is incredible.

15:56.500 --> 15:59.380
Belmondo almost never gets attached to anyone else but me.

16:04.220 --> 16:06.050
This kitty is my only friend.

16:06.680 --> 16:09.100
We're never separated no matter where we go.

16:15.230 --> 16:17.110
Well, your highness.

16:17.110 --> 16:19.360
Would you like to partake in my magic show?

16:21.320 --> 16:23.400
Kid's magic!?

16:28.280 --> 16:29.080
That's enough!

16:29.080 --> 16:31.250
I'll go catch Kid all by myself!

16:31.620 --> 16:34.040
All right, your highness, as per my instructions.

16:34.620 --> 16:35.960
I'm so thrilled!

16:38.550 --> 16:40.420
It's Kaitou Kid!

16:44.340 --> 16:44.930
Delon!

16:45.680 --> 16:47.350
Hurry, Kid has fled from the window!

16:49.560 --> 16:50.270
You won't get away!

16:50.890 --> 16:53.270
Look, it's Kaitou Kid!

17:06.360 --> 17:07.200
A balloon?

17:08.200 --> 17:08.870
Damn!

17:12.790 --> 17:14.460
What a close call!

17:14.660 --> 17:15.710
Gotta scram fast.

17:30.350 --> 17:32.810
You've blundered, Kaitou Kid.

17:32.810 --> 17:35.100
That gem glows even in the dark, you know?

17:36.480 --> 17:38.230
Do not fret, your highness.

17:38.230 --> 17:39.980
I am immortal.

17:39.980 --> 17:40.730
Kid...

17:44.690 --> 17:46.820
Guess the diamond bit the bullet, huh?

17:47.240 --> 17:51.080
Well, it goes to show how accurate my aim is.

17:55.410 --> 17:58.330
This is the end, Kid.

18:09.800 --> 18:10.890
Over there!?

18:12.850 --> 18:13.560
No way...

18:15.270 --> 18:17.350
Now can you tell which is the real one?

18:17.350 --> 18:18.520
Detective Deloony!

18:18.520 --> 18:19.650
It's Delon!

18:20.400 --> 18:22.230
Fooling around with such childish tricks!

18:27.070 --> 18:27.780
Kid...

18:29.610 --> 18:31.160
Kid, what are those lights?

18:31.910 --> 18:33.790
Chemical light sticks.

18:33.790 --> 18:34.700
They glow when bent.

18:35.160 --> 18:37.830
Damn, which light belongs to that bastard?

18:38.080 --> 18:39.250
Wait, hold on.

18:39.920 --> 18:41.580
If I recall, that diamond...

18:43.420 --> 18:47.010
Kid, I'll let you in on something good one last time.

18:47.010 --> 18:48.550
That diamond...

18:50.220 --> 18:52.350
Emits light in the shape of a cross!

19:07.150 --> 19:08.320
Loony.

19:11.530 --> 19:13.700
Your highness, this is the finale.

19:13.700 --> 19:15.950
Please hide yourself in there momentarily.

19:15.950 --> 19:17.660
We won't see each other again, right?

19:17.830 --> 19:18.960
Correct.

19:18.960 --> 19:20.210
Please take care of yourself.

19:21.870 --> 19:23.630
Then, as a parting gift...

19:30.800 --> 19:31.760
Somebody!

19:31.760 --> 19:32.840
Princess!

19:32.840 --> 19:34.930
Detective Delon and Kid just fell out of the window!

19:40.480 --> 19:41.770
Kid is after me!

19:43.690 --> 19:46.400
Princess Anne, where is that goon?

19:46.400 --> 19:48.400
He's in my room on the fourth floor!

19:48.780 --> 19:51.650
Thank goodness, it seems the gem is safe and sound.

19:52.410 --> 19:53.610
Yes...

19:53.610 --> 19:56.450
In that case, I shall take refuge in the annex...

19:57.620 --> 19:58.450
Hold it.

19:59.410 --> 20:03.120
Princess Anne, what happened to your cat?

20:03.120 --> 20:05.590
To see an enthusiastic felinophile like yourself...

20:05.590 --> 20:09.710
Abandon it for even a split second—how unnatural.

20:10.920 --> 20:12.760
Am I right?

20:12.760 --> 20:13.720
Princess Kid!

20:14.840 --> 20:15.850
Seize her!

20:15.850 --> 20:17.060
This is Kid in disguise!

20:21.980 --> 20:24.310
Which of you idiots stepped on my head!?

20:27.400 --> 20:29.480
As expected of Inspector Nakamori.

20:29.480 --> 20:31.900
I had no idea that the princess is a cat lover!

20:32.450 --> 20:34.280
Of course I already knew.

20:34.450 --> 20:36.280
It's your precious friend, after all.

20:36.620 --> 20:39.740
With you around, I'm having a hard time and I can't stand that.

20:40.160 --> 20:44.250
I cordially hope you can be dropped from my investigation.

20:44.920 --> 20:45.630
Adieu!

20:47.540 --> 20:48.540
Damn!

20:48.540 --> 20:50.380
He's gone again!

20:54.630 --> 20:56.510
So you managed to retrieve it!

20:56.510 --> 20:57.680
An amazing feat, Inspector!

20:58.680 --> 20:59.600
Brilliant!

21:02.930 --> 21:04.140
Dad!

21:04.390 --> 21:06.150
Aoko!

21:06.150 --> 21:07.610
You did it, Dad!

21:08.150 --> 21:09.820
Hey!

21:10.020 --> 21:12.780
Aoko, where are you?

21:12.900 --> 21:14.320
Kaito!

21:14.320 --> 21:15.530
Over here, over here!

21:18.700 --> 21:20.620
Aoko's back to her old self.

21:21.040 --> 21:23.330
Well, guess my plan was a success.

21:29.040 --> 21:31.460
ELITE JAPANESE POLICE
INSPECTOR NAKAMORI

21:31.670 --> 21:32.840
Damn...

21:33.300 --> 21:35.220
Hey, take a look at this.

21:35.220 --> 21:37.680
"Inspector Nakamori: It's My Long-Cultivated Hunch!"

21:37.680 --> 21:38.510
So it says!

21:38.510 --> 21:40.350
Dad's so putting on a show!

21:41.100 --> 21:42.010
Shut up!

21:42.010 --> 21:44.480
In fact, I'm the one who—!

21:50.060 --> 21:51.070
﻿I'm...

21:51.650 --> 21:52.940
You're what?

21:54.110 --> 21:55.740
I'm Kuroba Kaito!

21:58.320 --> 22:00.160
Such an idiot.

22:09.170 --> 22:10.040
Kid...

22:12.590 --> 22:15.470
Thank you for your fascinating magic!

23:44.470 --> 23:55.770
NEXT EPISODE

23:45.140 --> 23:47.140
Sakamoto Ryouma's three treasures.

23:47.140 --> 23:50.100
Kid's manifesto says he's not stealing them, but returning them!?

23:50.430 --> 23:51.730
You arrogant petty thief...

23:51.730 --> 23:53.730
What sort of scheme are you up to this time?

23:56.610 --> 23:59.490
